01:18:13,333 --> 01:18:19,333
USS Indianapolis: Men of Courage (also titled USS Indianapolis: Disaster in the Philippine Sea) is a 2016 American war disaster film directed by Mario Van Peebles and written
by Cam Cannon and Richard Rionda Del Castro, based largely on the true story of the loss of the ship of the same name in the closing stages of World War II.

12
01:25:20,000 --> 01:25:26,000
The film stars Nicolas Cage, Tom Sizemore, Thomas Jane,
Matt Lanter, Brian Presley, and Cody Walker.

13
01:32:26,666 --> 01:32:32,666
Principal photography began on June 19, 2015, in Mobile, Alabama.

14
01:39:33,333 --> 01:39:39,333
The film premiered in the Philippines on August 24, 2016.

15
01:46:40,000 --> 01:46:46,000
It was released as a digital rental on iTunes and Amazon in the United States on
October 14, 2016, and in limited theaters during the Veterans Day weekend.

16
01:53:46,666 --> 01:53:52,666
The film underperformed at the box office and
received negative reviews from critics.

